{"ticker":"CIEN","updated":"2026-10-30T22:40:29Z","profile":{"longName":"Ciena Corporation","shortName":"Ciena Corporation","sector":"Technology","industry":"Communication Equipment","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ciena.com","fullTimeEmployees":8898,"marketCap":45480833024,"trailingPE":71.74944,"forwardPE":27.035707,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":7.5538335,"pegRatio":0.35,"targetMeanPrice":512.9907,"targetHighPrice":660.0,"targetLowPrice":347.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.37,"earningsGrowth":4.229,"grossMargins":0.44072,"operatingMargins":0.18076,"profitMargins":0.10869,"totalRevenue":6020894208,"beta":1.289,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":637.51,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":168.22,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Ciena Corporation, a network technology company, provides hardware, software, and services for various network operators in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia Pacific, Japan, and India. It operates through Networking Platforms, Platform Software and Services, Blue Planet Automation Software and Services, and Global Services segments. The Networking Platforms segment consists optical networking, routing, and switching products and services. This segment products include the 6500 Packet-Optical Platform, Waveserver modular interconnect system, the 6500 Reconfigurable Line System, and coherent pluggable transceivers; and the 3000 family of service delivery platforms and the 5000 family of service aggregation, as well as the 8100 Coherent Routing platforms and virtualization software. The Platform Software and Services segment offers navigator network control suite; and software subscription services, consulting, network migration and integration, installation and upgrade support services, and technical support solutions. The Blue Planet Automation Software and Services segment inventory management, orchestration, route optimization and analysis, and unified assurance and analytics software; and sells subscription, installation, support, consulting, and design services related to the Blue Planet automation platform. The Global Services segment provides services","summary_zh":"Ciena Corporation 是一家網路技術公司，為美洲、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太地區、日本和印度的各種網路營運商提供硬體、軟體和服務。它透過網路平台、平台軟體和服務、藍色星球自動化軟體和服務以及全球服務部門運作。網路平台部門包括光網路、路由及交換產品及服務。此細分市場產品包括 6500 分組光平台、Waveserver 模組化互連繫統、6500 可重構線路系統和相干可插拔收發器； 3000 系列服務交付平台和 5000 系列服務聚合，以及 8100 相干路由平台和虛擬化軟體。平台軟體和服務部門提供導航器網路控制套件；軟體訂閱服務、諮詢、網路遷移和整合、安裝和升級支援服務以及技術支援解決方案。藍色星球自動化軟體和服務部門庫存管理、編排、路線最佳化和分析以及統一保證和分析軟體；並銷售與 Blue Planet 自動化平台相關的訂閱、安裝、支援、諮詢和設計服務。全球服務部門提供服務","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"通訊設備","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":92.68,"h":93.61,"l":90.0,"c":93.59,"v":2702400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":93.74,"h":95.21,"l":92.46,"c":94.82,"v":5741200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":115.0,"h":122.0,"l":110.9,"c":116.92,"v":11296500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":115.86,"h":117.06,"l":113.66,"c":116.69,"v":4410300},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":118.45,"h":120.18,"l":117.02,"c":119.0,"v":2593300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":119.0,"h":122.27,"l":117.94,"c":122.19,"v":2131800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":123.81,"h":131.4,"l":123.65,"c":129.86,"v":3431800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":131.0,"h":134.31,"l":130.0,"c":132.5,"v":3381100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":132.22,"h":133.28,"l":130.13,"c":131.28,"v":2778000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":132.0,"h":138.35,"l":131.45,"c":135.9,"v":3375500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":136.39,"h":137.64,"l":133.94,"c":137.48,"v":2907000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":139.55,"h":139.55,"l":132.93,"c":136.38,"v":3196700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":138.7,"h":139.74,"l":137.45,"c":138.04,"v":2048100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":137.71,"h":138.96,"l":136.07,"c":138.37,"v":3153500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":138.06,"h":139.44,"l":136.33,"c":139.31,"v":2613100},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":139.85,"h":141.43,"l":138.13,"c":139.48,"v":2846200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":139.38,"h":140.21,"l":136.04,"c":138.42,"v":2367300},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":134.51,"h":137.61,"l":133.67,"c":137.17,"v"