oc-news.de"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-12-12","period":"2025-11-01","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/936395/000162828025056698/cien-20251101.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are a network technology company, providing hardware, software, and services to a wide range of network operators and enabling enhanced network capacity, service delivery, and automation. Our solutions support network traffic across a wide range of applications, including cloud, voice, video, data, and artificial intelligence (\"AI\"). Our network solutions are used globally by cloud providers, service providers, and other network operators across multiple industry verticals.","zh":"我們是一家網路技術公司，為廣泛的網路營運商提供硬體、軟體和服務，並增強網路容量、服務交付和自動化。我們的解決方案支援各種應用程式的網路流量，包括雲端、語音、視訊、數據和人工智慧 (“AI”)。我們的網路解決方案被全球多個垂直行業的雲端供應商、服務供應商和其他網路營運商使用。"},{"en":"Our Networking Platforms, including our Optical Networking portfolio and Routing and Switching portfolio, are solutions applied from the network core to end user access points and allow network operators to scale capacity, increase transmission speeds, allocate traffic efficiently, and adapt dynamically to changing end-user service demands. Complementing our Networking Platforms, we offer Platform Software, which delivers multi-layer domain control and operations for network operators, and Blue Planet Automation Software, which enables service lifecycle management automation with productized operational support systems (\"OSS\") across domains and vendors. In addition to our hardware and software, we offer a broad range of complementary services that help our customers build, operate, and transform their networks and associated operational environments.","zh":"我們的網路平台，包括光網路產品組合以及路由和交換產品組合，是從網路核心到最終用戶存取點應用的解決方案，允許網路營運商擴展容量、提高傳輸速度、有效分配流量並動態適應不斷變化的最終用戶服務需求。為了補充我們的網路平台，我們提供平台軟體，為網路營運商提供多層域控制和運營，以及藍色星球自動化軟體，透過跨域和供應商的產品化營運支援系統（「OSS」）實現服務生命週期管理自動化。除了硬體和軟體之外，我們還提供廣泛的補充服務，幫助客戶建置、營運和改造其網路及相關營運環境。"},{"en":"Cloud Providers. Our cloud provider customers – also referred to in our markets as web-scale, hyper-scale or neo-scale providers – include internet content providers and providers of internet services and infrastructure, including data centers, cloud compute, Software as a Service (\"SaaS\"), storage, AI, and web hosting services. In addition to their direct purchases, these customers have also been significant purchasers of capacity on service provider submarine and wireline networks globally, and have heavily influenced networking solution demand and technology and architecture adopted by service providers.","zh":"雲端提供者。我們的雲端供應商客戶（在我們的市場中也稱為網路規模、超大規模或新規模供應商）包括網路內容供應商以及網路服務和基礎設施供應商，包括資料中心、雲端運算、軟體即服務（「SaaS」）、儲存、人工智慧和網路託管服務。除了直接購買之外，這些客戶還是全球服務供應商海底和有線網路容量的重要購買者，並且對網路解決方案需求以及服務供應商採用的技術和架構產生了重大影響。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our portfolio of products and services includes the solutions described below within our Networking Platforms, Platform Software and Services, Blue Planet Automation Software and Services, and Global Services operating segments.","zh":"我們的產品和服務組合包括我們的網路平台、平台軟體和服務、藍色星球自動化軟體和服務以及全球服務營運部門中所述的解決方案。"},{"en":"Optical Networking. Our Optical Networking portfolio includes a range of products that use our WaveLogic coherent optical technology, intelligent photonics solutions and other key components, including lasers, modulators, optical amplifiers, and wavelength multiplexers for efficient signal transmission and management. These products are often combined and sold as solutions that address network applications including cloud and AI networking, datacenter interconnect, long haul, metro, submarine connectivity, and MOFN. Key products within this portfolio include:","zh":"光網路。我們的光網路產品組合包括一系列使用 WaveLogic 相干光學技術、智慧光子解決方案和其他關鍵組件的產品，包括用於高效能訊號傳輸和管理的雷射、調製器、光放大器和波長復用器。這些產品通常組合在一起並作為解決方案出售，以解決雲端和人工智慧網路、資料中心互連、長途、城域、海底連接和 MOFN 等網路應用的問題。此產品組合中的主要產品包括："}],"customers":[{"en":"We sell our product and service solutions through direct and indirect sales channels to the following customer and market segments:","zh":"我們透過直接和間接銷售管道向以下客戶和細分市場銷售我們的產品和服務解決方案："},{"en":"Cloud Providers. Our cloud provider customers – also referred to in our markets as web-scale, hyper-scale or neo-scale providers – include internet content providers and providers of internet services and infrastructure, including data centers, cloud compute, Software as a Service (\"SaaS\"), storage, AI, and web hosting services. In addition to their direct purchases, these customers have also been significant purchasers of capacity on service provider submarine and wireline networks globally, and have heavily influenced networking solution demand and technology and architecture adopted by service providers.","zh":"雲端提供者。我們的雲端供應商客戶（在我們的市場中也稱為網路規模、超大規模或新規模供應商）包括網路內容供應商以及網路服務和基礎設施供應商，包括資料中心、雲端運算、軟體即服務（「SaaS」）、儲存、人工智慧和網路託管服務。除了直接購買之外，這些客戶還是全球服務供應商海底和有線網路容量的重要購買者，並且對網路解決方案需求以及服務供應商採用的技術和架構產生了重大影響。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Competition among networking solution vendors remains intense on a global basis. The market in which we compete is characterized by rapidly advancing technology, frequent introduction of new solutions, and aggressive selling efforts, including using significant pricing pressure to displace incumbent vendors and capture market share. Competition for sales of networking solutions is dominated by a small number of very large, multi-national companies. Our competitors include Nokia, Huawei, Cisco, Hewlett Packard Enterprise, and ZTE. As compared to us, many of these competitors have substantially greater financial, operational and marketing resources, and broader product offerings.","zh":"全球網路解決方案供應商之間的競爭依然激烈。我們競爭的市場的特點是技術快速發展、頻繁推出新解決方案以及積極的銷售努力，包括利用巨大的定價壓力來取代現有供應商並佔領市場份額。網路解決方案銷售的競爭由少數大型跨國公司主導。我們的競爭對手包括諾基亞、華為、思科、惠普企業和中興通訊。與我們相比，許多競爭對手擁有更多的財務、營運和行銷資源以及更廣泛的產品。"},{"en":"We also compete with several smaller but established companies that offer one or more products that compete directly or indirectly with our offerings or whose products address specific geographic, technology or customer segments. In addition, as we advance our interconnects and market expansion strategy to address needs inside and around the data center, we will begin to compete with additional competitors, including Marvell Technology Group, Credo Technology Group, and Broadcom. Competitors for our Blue Planet Automation Software include Cisco, Nokia, Amdocs, ServiceNow, Netcracker, and Ericsson.","zh":"我們也與幾家規模較小但成熟的公司競爭，這些公司提供一種或多種產品，與我們的產品直接或間接競爭，或其產品針對特定的地理、技術或客戶群。此外，隨著我們推動互連和市場擴張策略以滿足資料中心內部和周圍的需求，我們將開始與其他競爭對手競爭，包括 Marvell Technology Group、Credo Technology Group 和 Broadcom。我们的 Blue Planet 自动化软件的竞争对手包括思科、诺基亚、Amdocs、ServiceNow、Netcracker 和爱立信。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-11-01","items":[{"name":"Networking Platforms","val":3676377000,"zh":"網路平台部門"},{"name":"Global Services","val":613753000,"zh":"全球服務"},{"name":"Platform Softwareand Services","val":363830000,"zh":"平台軟體和服務部門"},{"name":"Blue Planet Automation Softwareand Services","val":115547000,"zh":"藍色星球自動化軟體與服務部門"}],"total":4769507000},"prod":{"end":"2025-11-01","items":[{"name":"Optical Networking","val":3246239000,"zh":"光網路"},{"name":"Service","val":946889000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Routing & Switching","val":430138000,"zh":"路由與交換"},{"name":"Platform Softwareand Services","val":363830000,"zh":"平台軟體和服務"},{"name":"Maintenance Support & Learning","val":317247000,"zh":"維護支援和學習"},{"name":"Implementation","val":246047000,"zh":"執行"},{"name":"Blue Planet Automation Softwareand Services","val":115547000,"zh":"藍色星球自動化軟體和服務"},{"name":"Advisory & Enablement","val":50459000,"zh":"諮詢與支持"}],"total":4769507000},"geo":{"end":"2025-11-01","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":3606407000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"EMEA","val":731912000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":431188000,"zh":"亞太"}],"total":4769507000}},"peers":["GLW","LITE","COHR","NTAP","RMBS"]}}